p/4541470/Deadzone_Rogue_2_Demo/ Play solo or with friends Take on the Deadzone solo or squad up with friends in co-op. Fight your way through waves of hostile machines, build your loadout, and see how far your squad can make it. The server browser and drop-in co-op are also availa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T16:59:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930595","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4465790-1845383656383843","game_id":"steam-4465790","kind":"announcement","title":"Deadzone Rogue 2 Demo is Launching October 8","summary":"The Deadzone Rogue 2 demo is coming soon to PC, PS5, and Xbox Play the demo solo or with friends on PC, PS5, and Xbox! Wishlist Deadzone Rogue 2 now to be first to know when it drops. https://store.steampowered.com/app/4465790/Deadzone_Rogue_2/ Play solo or with friends Take on the Deadzone solo or squad up with friends in co-op. Fight your way through waves of hostile machines, build your loadout, and see how far your squad can make it. The server browser and drop-in co-op will also be availabl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T19:54:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383843","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4465790-1842846814451311","game_id":"steam-4465790","kind":"announcement","title":"Quick Playtest Recap + Demo Coming up Next","summary":"Hey fellow Rogues, Thank you for joining us during the playtest! What a crazy past couple of weeks! A few of us at the studio (well, maybe just me) kept waking up at 4AM for a week or so because it was just so exciting to see players enjoying the game, getting feedback, and putting ourselves out there a bit. We wanted to give a quick update on how the playtest went, now that things have settled down a little and Labor Day weekend is here. Hope everyone enjoys some great weather and time with fam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T17:30:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451311","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4465790-1841579228673821","game_id":"steam-4465790","kind":"announcement","title":"Deadzone Rogue 2 Playtest is Closed - Thank You!","summary":"Fellow Rogues, the Playtest is officially closed! A huge THANK YOU to everyone who jumped in and played! If you have any feedback from the playtest, we'd love to hear it to keep improving. Definitely let us know what you think in this short survey, or via #playtest-feedback in the Discord, or on Reddit. And if you enjoyed the playtest, be sure to wishlist Deadzone Rogue 2 on Steam for updates: https://store.steampowered.com/app/4465790/Deadzone_Rogue_2/ The demo will be coming up next, in about ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T18:03:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228673821","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4465790-1841579228669973","game_id":"steam-4465790","kind":"announcement","title":"Bug Fixes based on Feedback","summary":"DZ2 Playtest Patch Notes - 0.1.0.1 Fixes Performance improvements to fix several crashes. Fixed an issue where checkpoints would not load the player’s build when returning to mission. Fixed an issue where the Defense and Offense categories were swapped in the Imprint Codex. Fixed several items’ SFX that were playing incorrectly on other players. Augments Added new icons for the Heresy Augment. Adjusted wording on the Heresy Augment to make it more clear. Changed Heresy Augment to build up faster","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T20:10:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228669973","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4465790-1841579228666671","game_id":"steam-4465790","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Deadzone Rogue 2 Playtest is LIVE","summary":"The Deadzone Rogue 2 Playtest is LIVE! The playtest is free and open to everyone on Steam, through August 23. Just click 'Join the Playtest' on the Deadzone Rogue 2 Steam page to jump in. https://store.steampowered.com/app/4465790/Deadzone_Rogue_2/ {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46121263/3f9eb4533d5dd51bf98d4e6da6177667af9b4ffa.png Play solo or with friends Take on the Deadzone solo or squad up with two friends in co-op. The server browser is live, along with a new drop-in feature so you can jump into a co-","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T19:49:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228666671","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4465790-1840944183777877","game_id":"steam-4465790","kind":"announcement","title":"Deadzone Rogue 2 Playtest Opens August 20-23","summary":"To sign up, head to our Steam page and click the 'Request Access' button. The playtest is free and open to anyone on Steam, from August 20-23. Just click the 'Request Access' button on the Deadzone Rogue 2 Steam page to lock in your spot. https://store.steampowered.com/app/4465790/Deadzone_Rogue_2/ {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46121263/3f9eb4533d5dd51bf98d4e6da6177667af9b4ffa.png This is an early playtest, running August 20-23 We're mainly focused on technical testing and getting your early feedback! Plea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T20:54:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183777877","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4465790-1836506165547295","game_id":"steam-4465790","kind":"announcement","title":"Alpha Playtest Signups Are Open!","summary":"Hey fellow Rogues, Signups are now open for the Deadzone Rogue 2 Alpha playtest! This will be an early alpha test of the game, meant for technical testing. We expect the Alpha playtest to go live in the next 1–3 months, and it'll be free and open to anyone who signs up on Steam. The demo will come at a later time. To sign up, head to our Steam page and click the 'Request Access' button. That reserves your spot, since the alpha playtest isn't live yet (sign up screenshot is below). We'll announce","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T23:04:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165547295","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4465790-1832065502824762","game_id":"steam-4465790","kind":"announcement","title":"Deadzone Rogue 2 Announced - Free Demo Coming Soon","summary":"Deadzone Rogue 2 Announced - Thank You! We've been quietly working on something for a while, and today we're finally ready to announce it: Deadzone Rogue 2. To the 750,000+ players who made this moment possible, we truly appreciate your support. Thank you so much, from our entire team! Why We're Creating a Sequel We’re having a blast building Deadzone Rogue, and players are asking for more! Deadzone Rogue 2 gives us the chance to expand on everything we love about the original while introducing "